        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-21T17:29:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Overdrive says you can use Strike twice this turn and after the first Overdrive you have fulfilled that. &nbsp;So the second Overdrive does nothing since Strike was already used twice this turn unless you skipped using Strike for some reason. &nbsp;Even if Fixer managed to play Overdrive twice on his own turn he can still only use Strike twice on his turn.&nbsp;</p>",
