      {
        "id": 139610,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-21T17:30:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It has already been an official ruling that more than 1 Overdrive played would still only result in 2 Strikes max. The reason Pydro gave above is 100% correct.</p><p>Maybe this is like Crowbars where there has been a change in the previous official ruling. But I'm inclined to think it's a bug.</p><p>Hey MigrantP, are you lurking around anywhere?</p>",
